WEBVTT

01:30.910 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.009 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 15]

01:38.950 --> 01:39.710
Yimei.

01:41.509 --> 01:42.509
Come on, sit down.

01:50.920 --> 01:52.180
You're a grown-up now.

01:52.920 --> 01:54.640
You need to mind your words.

01:55.590 --> 01:57.479
Although our two families live close by,

01:57.479 --> 01:58.350
once you're married,

01:58.350 --> 02:00.350
don't run back home too frequently.

02:00.440 --> 02:02.420
Your mother-in-law is a reasonable person.

02:02.420 --> 02:03.280
Even I admire her when I

02:03.280 --> 02:05.210
hear about how she handles things.

02:05.750 --> 02:06.680
Besides, Pingyuan

02:06.680 --> 02:08.210
wouldn't dare to upset you.

02:09.120 --> 02:10.050
If there's really

02:10.050 --> 02:11.610
something you can't get over,

02:11.610 --> 02:13.460
you can always talk to your mother-in-law.

02:13.460 --> 02:14.320
Remember that?

02:18.280 --> 02:18.800
Father.

02:25.190 --> 02:26.840
Finally, this day has come.

02:28.130 --> 02:29.460
That day, when he told me

02:29.470 --> 02:30.650
that he'd marry you very soon,

02:30.650 --> 02:33.030
I felt I could die happy right then.

02:36.960 --> 02:37.590
Good.

02:40.820 --> 02:42.820
Do you think I'm not a good daughter?

02:43.250 --> 02:45.180
Why are you rushing to send me away?

02:51.350 --> 02:52.079
Sweetheart,

02:53.770 --> 02:55.000
what did you just say?

02:59.410 --> 03:01.340
I haven't thought about marriage.

03:05.840 --> 03:07.970
Keeping you waiting for so many years,

03:08.200 --> 03:09.520
that boy owes you a lot.

03:10.310 --> 03:10.970
He knows it.

03:11.030 --> 03:12.240
He'll treat you well.

03:14.510 --> 03:15.030
Father,

03:15.630 --> 03:17.030
he doesn't owe me anything.

03:17.030 --> 03:19.020
And I don't need him to treat me well.

03:19.020 --> 03:21.090
No one owes anyone anything in this world.

03:21.090 --> 03:22.840
Please don't talk like this anymore.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.550
If you want me to get married now

03:24.550 --> 03:26.000
so that you can drive me out,

03:26.000 --> 03:27.000
then I'll do it.

03:27.390 --> 03:29.190
Did you hear something from others?

03:29.190 --> 03:31.590
Is that why you're
in a hurry to push me away?

03:34.910 --> 03:35.310
You...

03:37.860 --> 03:38.430
You...

03:41.440 --> 03:43.520
W-What are you saying?

03:47.280 --> 03:49.210
W-What do you think you're saying?

03:50.730 --> 03:52.160
You're my own daughter!

03:52.230 --> 03:54.230
How could I believe what others say?

03:56.110 --> 03:57.810
Pingyuan risked his life,

03:58.170 --> 04:00.190
rushing back and forth
to the military camp.

04:00.190 --> 04:01.840
We all care so much about you!

04:02.290 --> 04:03.150
You are really

04:03.190 --> 04:04.360
pissing me off.

04:05.100 --> 04:05.760
Hey, you...

04:05.860 --> 04:07.630
Why are you being so difficult?

04:09.400 --> 04:10.600
Look at these things.

04:12.600 --> 04:13.190
Father!

04:13.590 --> 04:14.150
Father!

04:14.150 --> 04:15.500
Check them out!

04:15.620 --> 04:17.240
Look at them!

04:17.430 --> 04:18.360
Father, please come down.

04:18.360 --> 04:19.620
I don't need your help.

04:19.660 --> 04:20.350
Father.

04:21.410 --> 04:22.000
Father!

04:23.390 --> 04:24.270
Girl,

04:25.190 --> 04:27.360
w-why are you being so stubborn?

04:37.480 --> 04:37.950
Father,

04:38.950 --> 04:40.360
I'm sorry, okay?

04:51.120 --> 04:52.190
Girl.

04:57.650 --> 04:58.870
Look at them.

04:59.590 --> 05:00.960
Look at these things.

05:01.440 --> 05:02.680
I've been saving every penny

05:02.680 --> 05:04.320
from daily expenses
year after year to buy them.

05:04.320 --> 05:04.970
How could you say

05:04.970 --> 05:06.430
that I'm driving you out?

05:06.730 --> 05:07.510
How could you say

05:07.510 --> 05:08.710
something like that?

05:20.770 --> 05:21.970
It's so infuriating.

05:23.750 --> 05:26.080
I never said I wouldn't marry him, Father.

05:26.540 --> 05:28.640
Why are you yelling at me?

05:52.500 --> 05:54.630
The imperial court's troops are here!

05:54.680 --> 05:55.500
[Battalion Commander of the Qing Army]

05:54.870 --> 05:56.240
Where's your village head?

05:56.240 --> 05:57.700
Here! I'm here!

05:57.950 --> 05:58.610
Commander!

05:58.680 --> 06:00.360
I'll go over there. I'm going.

06:00.450 --> 06:01.580
Let me go over there.

06:05.840 --> 06:07.750
[Village Head of Shanjian Village]

06:06.560 --> 06:07.360
C-Commander,

06:07.600 --> 06:08.530
at your service.

06:09.750 --> 06:10.350
Listen up.

06:11.480 --> 06:12.800
Send 50 men each day

06:13.240 --> 06:15.020
to mend the trenches outside the camp.

06:15.020 --> 06:16.400
And get 50 more porters

06:16.830 --> 06:18.030
to gather horse feed.

06:18.360 --> 06:20.630
The General said
the troops won't enter the village

06:20.630 --> 06:21.890
and won't disturb you.

06:22.630 --> 06:25.720
The imperial court's troops are
truly honorable.

06:26.830 --> 06:29.030
We'll get everything ready right away.

06:30.760 --> 06:31.690
Here's the case.

06:32.470 --> 06:34.040
We have marched thousands of miles,

06:34.040 --> 06:35.480
risking our lives to get here,

06:35.480 --> 06:37.010
and we're getting nothing?

06:38.360 --> 06:40.420
How could we leave you empty-handed?

06:40.510 --> 06:42.000
I need to go back to the village

06:42.000 --> 06:43.730
to discuss with the villagers.

06:43.920 --> 06:45.920
You know, over these years in this area,

06:45.920 --> 06:48.240
there's been endless fighting
like a tug of war,

06:48.240 --> 06:49.800
and all the tea plantations
have been burned down.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.450
I also want to offer your soldiers

06:51.450 --> 06:52.450
something.

06:53.480 --> 06:55.480
But there isn't much we can provide.

06:56.190 --> 06:56.920
Come closer.

06:57.830 --> 06:58.580
Commander...

06:58.580 --> 06:59.159
Commander...

06:59.159 --> 06:59.490
Well.

07:01.040 --> 07:01.450
Sir...

07:01.480 --> 07:03.420
Sir, please give me a hint.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.850
After all these years of fighting,

07:07.360 --> 07:08.720
every village has a few rich men

07:08.720 --> 07:10.940
who are on good terms
with the rebels, right?

07:10.940 --> 07:13.380
These people must be punished.

07:14.620 --> 07:16.480
In the best case, they get exiled.

07:16.490 --> 07:17.620
In the worst case...

07:17.890 --> 07:19.090
Off with their heads!

07:23.600 --> 07:24.460
Listen, buddy.

07:24.600 --> 07:26.370
Go discuss with them if necessary.

07:26.370 --> 07:27.980
To save your pathetic life,

07:28.570 --> 07:29.860
you need to pay a lot.

07:30.950 --> 07:32.550
Off you go. I'll wait for you.

07:33.840 --> 07:34.770
Move it!

07:35.420 --> 07:37.170
Yes, Commander. I got it.

07:37.430 --> 07:38.159
I'm leaving.

07:44.159 --> 07:45.090
Come on, Mr. Bai.

07:45.630 --> 07:46.120
Come on.

07:47.040 --> 07:47.770
Take it slow.

07:49.440 --> 07:49.950
Okay.

07:50.620 --> 07:51.280
Here you go.

07:53.950 --> 07:54.870
Fetch a doctor.

07:55.250 --> 07:56.770
Any delay, and he won't get up again.

07:56.770 --> 07:57.310
Got it.

07:58.870 --> 07:59.450
Father!

07:59.650 --> 08:00.380
Don't worry.

08:01.240 --> 08:02.770
I was scaring Pingwen a bit.

08:02.910 --> 08:04.280
Mr. Bai is having a phlegm blockage,

08:04.280 --> 08:05.790
with his heart channels clogged.

08:05.790 --> 08:07.130
Don't be afraid, Mr. Bai.

08:07.130 --> 08:08.470
The doctor will be right here.

08:08.470 --> 08:10.800
The acupuncture treatment will cure you.

08:11.680 --> 08:12.040
I...

08:14.000 --> 08:15.530
Stop stuttering like this.

08:15.770 --> 08:17.170
Don't stand here crying.

08:17.660 --> 08:18.920
Go wait for me outside.

08:19.120 --> 08:19.850
Go out first.

08:22.510 --> 08:23.040
Mr. Bai,

08:23.510 --> 08:24.870
it's alright, don't worry.

08:24.870 --> 08:26.470
The doctor will be here soon.

08:40.669 --> 08:42.000
What happened just now?

08:42.150 --> 08:44.010
How did you get him this worked up?

08:45.840 --> 08:46.320
Yimei,

08:47.100 --> 08:49.030
don't be fooled by his closed eyes.

08:49.320 --> 08:49.960
He can hear

08:50.190 --> 08:51.050
and understand

08:51.080 --> 08:52.280
everything clearly.

08:53.200 --> 08:54.360
Say more comforting words

08:54.360 --> 08:55.220
to him later.

08:56.510 --> 08:57.570
If you talk back to him again,

08:57.570 --> 08:59.830
aren't you pushing him toward his grave?

09:02.100 --> 09:03.740
Why did you save me?

09:04.870 --> 09:06.080
If I had died in there,

09:06.670 --> 09:08.360
wouldn't you all be at peace now?

09:08.360 --> 09:10.020
Why are you saying this again?

09:11.000 --> 09:12.670
If I hadn't gotten you out of there,

09:12.670 --> 09:14.390
your father would have
passed away already.

09:14.390 --> 09:16.990
If anything happens
to my father because of me,

09:17.740 --> 09:19.460
I just don't deserve to live.

09:20.480 --> 09:21.720
What should I do?

09:23.130 --> 09:24.510
What do you mean
by "don't deserve to live"?

09:24.510 --> 09:25.770
You're still so young.

09:27.670 --> 09:28.750
You were forcibly taken away

09:28.750 --> 09:30.150
by someone with a weapon.

09:30.440 --> 09:31.700
You did nothing wrong.

09:32.270 --> 09:34.070
If anyone's to blame, it's them.

09:34.280 --> 09:36.140
They couldn't stand up
to the imperial court themselves,

09:36.140 --> 09:36.960
so they came here,

09:36.960 --> 09:38.150
throwing their weight around.

09:38.150 --> 09:39.100
Kidnapping women and children,

09:39.100 --> 09:40.500
what the hell did they do?

09:40.790 --> 09:42.030
I think those guys are the ones

09:42.030 --> 09:43.490
who don't deserve to live.

09:49.630 --> 09:50.320
Mr. Bai!

09:51.720 --> 09:52.240
Mr. Bai!

09:53.440 --> 09:53.910
Mr. Xu.

09:55.090 --> 09:56.220
G-Gu, you're here.

09:58.360 --> 09:59.290
Where is Mr. Bai?

09:59.360 --> 10:00.440
He was choked by phlegm just now

10:00.440 --> 10:01.600
and won't wake up anytime soon.

10:01.600 --> 10:03.400
Anything wrong? You can tell me.

10:04.750 --> 10:05.480
Come with me.

10:08.510 --> 10:09.080
Look.

10:09.790 --> 10:11.510
I'm just a minor village head.

10:11.540 --> 10:13.120
All I want is peace

10:13.140 --> 10:14.070
for the village.

10:15.150 --> 10:16.270
Those from the east

10:16.320 --> 10:17.200
boss me around,

10:17.710 --> 10:18.530
and those from the west

10:18.530 --> 10:19.990
don't treat me any better.

10:20.270 --> 10:21.200
Gu, don't

10:21.540 --> 10:22.470
blame me

10:23.150 --> 10:24.080
for saying this.

10:24.480 --> 10:25.100
Go on.

10:29.020 --> 10:30.290
The Battalion Commander
wants me to find those

10:30.290 --> 10:31.570
who work with the enemy in the village.

10:31.570 --> 10:33.360
In times like these,
everyone's trying to flee for their lives.

10:33.360 --> 10:34.050
Where am I supposed

10:34.050 --> 10:35.250
to find any traitors?

10:35.870 --> 10:37.530
But once I accepted this task,

10:37.750 --> 10:39.150
I must deliver some results.

10:39.150 --> 10:40.040
So,

10:40.510 --> 10:41.460
you came to Mr. Bai's place

10:41.460 --> 10:42.520
for the "results"?

10:42.960 --> 10:43.670
G-Gu,

10:44.320 --> 10:45.720
you can't talk like this.

10:45.750 --> 10:47.030
I also studied the books

10:47.030 --> 10:49.090
of morality and virtues from Mr. Bai.

10:49.840 --> 10:50.750
If I do something like that,

10:50.750 --> 10:52.600
God will strike me with lightning.

10:52.600 --> 10:55.000
I'm asking Mr. Bai
to figure out a solution.

10:55.800 --> 10:57.270
His life is at stake! Hurry up!

10:57.270 --> 10:58.270
It's an emergency! Quickly!

10:58.270 --> 11:00.070
My shoes! They're slipping off!

11:00.870 --> 11:02.720
You brat...

11:02.750 --> 11:04.390
-Pingwen, give him a hand.
-I don't need your help.

11:04.390 --> 11:05.450
I can walk on my own.

11:05.630 --> 11:06.630
I'll do it myself.

11:08.320 --> 11:08.980
Be careful.

11:09.510 --> 11:10.000
Come on.

11:11.770 --> 11:12.270
Well...

11:16.630 --> 11:17.000
Wait.

11:17.360 --> 11:18.630
Where are you going, Gu?

11:18.630 --> 11:19.550
Didn't you want to talk to me?

11:19.550 --> 11:19.840
No.

11:20.030 --> 11:21.930
I-I need to see Mr. Bai.

11:22.120 --> 11:22.480
Hey.

11:22.650 --> 11:24.240
Where are you taking me?

11:29.570 --> 11:30.600
I'm Gu Pingyuan,

11:31.090 --> 11:32.430
seeking an audience with General Qiao.

11:32.430 --> 11:33.160
Bring him in.

11:43.550 --> 11:44.000
Sir.

11:46.080 --> 11:46.610
Go ahead.

11:47.790 --> 11:48.200
Sir,

11:49.000 --> 11:49.740
Anhui's been going through

11:49.740 --> 11:51.340
really tough times the past few years.

11:51.340 --> 11:54.780
[General Qiao of the Qing Army]

11:51.430 --> 11:52.690
The ceaseless battles

11:53.150 --> 11:55.390
have drained all resources
from our countryside.

11:55.390 --> 11:55.870
We truly

11:55.870 --> 11:57.400
have nothing left to offer.

11:57.630 --> 11:59.440
The villagers thought
I might be able to work things out,

11:59.440 --> 12:00.320
so they sent me over

12:00.320 --> 12:02.150
to discuss
this matter with you, General.

12:02.150 --> 12:03.630
The imperial court owes us wages

12:03.630 --> 12:05.490
that haven't been paid for years.

12:05.670 --> 12:07.150
My men are risking

12:07.180 --> 12:08.750
their lives in battle,

12:09.010 --> 12:10.230
but what about their families?

12:10.230 --> 12:11.230
What's your idea?

12:11.880 --> 12:14.290
You must give your offerings.

12:14.770 --> 12:16.630
Arrest some traitors and beat them up.

12:16.630 --> 12:17.360
So you can get

12:18.200 --> 12:19.330
the money from them.

12:20.970 --> 12:21.600
What?

12:26.920 --> 12:28.180
Are you a traitor, too?

12:29.120 --> 12:29.750
Sir,

12:30.510 --> 12:32.310
we truly have no silver to offer.

12:33.090 --> 12:34.110
The rebels set fire

12:34.110 --> 12:34.960
to our tea plantations

12:34.960 --> 12:36.290
and burned everything.

12:36.560 --> 12:38.630
The villagers just trade their possessions

12:38.630 --> 12:39.690
for new seedlings.

12:39.790 --> 12:41.220
We'll harvest a crop and sell the tea

12:41.220 --> 12:42.180
after the Qingming Festival.

12:42.180 --> 12:43.550
Only then will we have some income.

12:43.550 --> 12:45.440
You're asking me to wait until you

12:45.480 --> 12:46.870
grow and sell your tea?

12:47.130 --> 12:49.040
Why don't you say you'll get married now

12:49.040 --> 12:50.690
and raise your child to join the army?

12:50.690 --> 12:51.660
What a joke!

12:51.870 --> 12:52.630
Report!

13:12.250 --> 13:12.960
The map.

13:14.370 --> 13:14.710
[The four camps of the South Army
under the mountain have marched to Hefei.]

13:14.710 --> 13:16.430
[Chizhou Prefecture]

13:22.030 --> 13:22.960
Take him away.

13:23.990 --> 13:26.390
I'll deal with him
after I defeat the enemy.

13:27.270 --> 13:28.130
Relay my order!

13:28.140 --> 13:29.360
Break camp tonight!

13:55.550 --> 13:57.010
Do you have a fire starter?

13:57.120 --> 13:57.600
Yes.

13:57.640 --> 13:58.320
Go get it.

13:59.230 --> 14:00.550
And bring a small stove, too.

14:00.550 --> 14:01.150
Got it.

14:01.230 --> 14:01.960
Here you are.

14:02.210 --> 14:04.180
You're way too rough. Take it away!

14:05.080 --> 14:05.920
Don't mess up

14:05.940 --> 14:06.840
my things!

14:07.270 --> 14:08.400
M-Move. Move aside.

14:13.320 --> 14:13.910
Sir.

14:14.320 --> 14:15.120
Put them down.

14:18.080 --> 14:19.320
This medicine of mine is

14:19.320 --> 14:20.440
a mix

14:20.670 --> 14:21.330
of gentian,

14:21.390 --> 14:23.000
musk,

14:23.250 --> 14:24.130
and pine oil.

14:25.080 --> 14:27.910
It clears all the senses
and soothes the spleen and stomach.

14:27.910 --> 14:29.370
One whiff will wake him up.

14:43.030 --> 14:43.490
Father.

14:53.120 --> 14:53.630
Father.

15:00.330 --> 15:01.660
Don't rush to speak yet.

15:02.010 --> 15:03.550
Try to move your hands

15:03.590 --> 15:04.390
and feet.

15:13.510 --> 15:16.070
A second chance at life.

15:18.360 --> 15:19.440
Thank you, Sir.

15:29.600 --> 15:30.400
In the future,

15:30.720 --> 15:31.510
you should take the patient out

15:31.510 --> 15:32.640
for walks more often

15:32.910 --> 15:34.170
and get some sunshine.

15:34.790 --> 15:35.600
This illness,

15:36.030 --> 15:37.630
though fatal when it flares up,

15:37.630 --> 15:39.960
will be fine
once the phlegm is coughed up.

15:41.420 --> 15:43.280
This is my prescription for you.

15:43.560 --> 15:44.050
You

15:44.200 --> 15:45.480
should follow this prescription

15:45.480 --> 15:46.410
to get the herbs.

15:46.960 --> 15:47.440
They're

15:47.460 --> 15:49.610
surely available in Huizhou,

15:49.910 --> 15:51.360
but I'm not sure if there's

15:51.360 --> 15:53.180
still fighting going on there.

15:53.750 --> 15:54.350
Fighting?

15:54.720 --> 15:56.710
Haven't you heard
that the fighting stopped long ago?

15:56.710 --> 15:58.270
The soldiers
hunted them down to Liuhu Town

15:58.270 --> 15:59.600
and killed many people.

15:59.840 --> 16:02.170
They even killed the commanding general.

16:03.480 --> 16:04.600
Dogs stop barking

16:05.270 --> 16:06.670
once they get some bones.

16:07.030 --> 16:08.760
With such a great achievement,

16:09.270 --> 16:11.930
they surely won't
mess with my brother anymore.

16:12.360 --> 16:12.910
Sir,

16:13.180 --> 16:14.270
this is so fragrant.

16:14.270 --> 16:15.440
Can I have one?

16:17.020 --> 16:18.920
Hands off my stuff!

16:19.150 --> 16:20.150
Give it back to me.

17:38.350 --> 17:38.960
Father.

17:43.900 --> 17:44.830
Tell me

17:45.750 --> 17:46.830
what I should do.

17:52.210 --> 17:53.270
Tell me.

17:55.070 --> 17:56.160
What should I do?

17:58.200 --> 17:59.480
What should I do?

18:03.730 --> 18:05.070
What should I do?

18:15.070 --> 18:15.720
Pingwen!

18:16.350 --> 18:17.000
Pingwen!

18:16.600 --> 18:18.920
[Two days later]

18:17.440 --> 18:18.830
Pingyuan has returned!

18:20.130 --> 18:21.130
Pingyuan is back!

18:23.070 --> 18:23.600
Pingwen.

18:24.200 --> 18:25.200
Pingyuan is back.

18:25.890 --> 18:26.850
He's returned.

18:27.550 --> 18:28.270
Over there.

18:29.270 --> 18:30.810
Pingwen, slow down.

18:30.880 --> 18:31.640
You speed up!

18:32.240 --> 18:33.840
I can't run anymore.

18:34.640 --> 18:35.240
Pingyuan.

18:35.610 --> 18:36.210
Pingyuan.

18:36.390 --> 18:37.250
Don't touch me.

18:37.400 --> 18:37.960
It hurts.

18:40.240 --> 18:40.840
Pingyuan,

18:41.070 --> 18:42.270
you're finally back.

18:43.350 --> 18:45.000
Where are those soldiers?

18:45.340 --> 18:46.510
They won a great victory

18:46.510 --> 18:48.310
and broke camp to head for Hefei.

18:49.750 --> 18:51.150
Pingyuan, your hands...

18:53.030 --> 18:54.290
Let's go home quickly.

18:54.360 --> 18:56.200
Mother asks about you
hundreds of times a day.

18:56.200 --> 18:56.790
I lied to her, saying

18:56.790 --> 18:58.400
that you went down the mountain
to buy wedding gifts.

18:58.400 --> 19:00.600
Do I look like I'm buying wedding gifts?

19:00.790 --> 19:01.350
Tell her

19:01.890 --> 19:03.150
that I bought the gifts

19:03.240 --> 19:04.440
and sent them to Mr. Bai's house.

19:04.440 --> 19:06.040
I'll come home after dinner.

19:06.110 --> 19:07.440
Her eyesight is poor at night,

19:07.440 --> 19:08.960
so I can fool her and get away with it.

19:08.960 --> 19:09.870
How is Mr. Bai?

19:10.480 --> 19:11.790
Go check on him yourself.

19:11.790 --> 19:12.660
When we heard you got in trouble,

19:12.660 --> 19:14.320
he was worried sick about you.

19:20.070 --> 19:20.750
Yimei!

19:22.480 --> 19:23.070
Coming.

19:35.470 --> 19:36.400
Where is Mr. Bai?

19:37.200 --> 19:38.800
What happened to your hands?

19:38.940 --> 19:39.660
Oh dear,

19:40.440 --> 19:42.070
they tied me up to prevent me

19:42.090 --> 19:43.150
from running away.

19:56.550 --> 19:57.070
Sir.

19:57.710 --> 19:58.680
I'm back.

19:59.030 --> 20:00.290
Pingyuan, quickly...

20:01.200 --> 20:02.110
Don't talk.

20:02.190 --> 20:02.750
Lie down

20:02.920 --> 20:03.720
and rest well.

20:04.830 --> 20:05.610
Take good care of yourself.

20:05.610 --> 20:06.400
When you recover,

20:06.400 --> 20:07.730
we'll plan the wedding.

20:10.090 --> 20:11.120
All right.

20:13.100 --> 20:14.190
Mr. Bai looks

20:14.480 --> 20:15.410
much better now.

20:16.880 --> 20:18.310
The acupuncture treatment this morning

20:18.310 --> 20:19.830
helped clear the phlegm from his chest,

20:19.830 --> 20:21.190
and his body stopped trembling.

20:21.190 --> 20:22.160
The doctor said that it needs

20:22.160 --> 20:24.270
10 consecutive days of treatment
to cure completely.

20:24.270 --> 20:26.270
Thanks to Pingwen, who ran quickly.

20:26.400 --> 20:27.200
This illness,

20:27.550 --> 20:30.550
if not treated promptly,
could be life-threatening.

20:30.720 --> 20:31.880
Mr. Bai is blessed.

20:32.730 --> 20:34.460
The good days are ahead of you.

20:37.240 --> 20:37.680
Yimei,

20:38.240 --> 20:38.770
let's go.

20:48.030 --> 20:49.560
Hurry and pack your things.

20:49.590 --> 20:50.520
We need to leave.

20:51.350 --> 20:52.070
Leave?

20:52.200 --> 20:53.960
I'll prepare a carriage
for you and your father

20:53.960 --> 20:55.290
to go down the mountain.

20:55.830 --> 20:56.430
Why are you

20:57.170 --> 20:58.830
suddenly telling us to leave?

20:59.000 --> 21:00.410
The situation has changed.

21:00.410 --> 21:01.940
If you stay here any longer,

21:02.070 --> 21:03.800
I'm afraid you'll be in danger.

21:04.010 --> 21:06.010
My father still needs acupuncture.

21:06.030 --> 21:06.700
If necessary,

21:06.700 --> 21:08.350
we'll take the doctor
down the mountain, too.

21:08.350 --> 21:08.920
Pingwen says

21:08.920 --> 21:10.270
he has a friend
at the foot of the mountain,

21:10.270 --> 21:11.260
who owns a large house

21:11.260 --> 21:12.400
about 15 kilometers from here.

21:12.400 --> 21:13.730
You go hide there first.

21:14.480 --> 21:15.700
If the situation remains tense,

21:15.700 --> 21:17.030
you can move elsewhere.

21:17.590 --> 21:18.920
Anyway, I have friends in Shanxi,

21:18.920 --> 21:20.250
and in the capital, too.

21:20.490 --> 21:21.550
In this vast world,

21:21.610 --> 21:22.870
you can live anywhere.

21:23.120 --> 21:23.970
When

21:24.160 --> 21:25.090
this battle is over,

21:25.090 --> 21:26.330
I'll bring you back.

21:31.310 --> 21:31.790
Well...

21:32.270 --> 21:34.640
The imperial court's troops are gathering
in greater numbers.

21:34.640 --> 21:36.100
If word gets around,

21:36.640 --> 21:39.250
it will spell destruction
for your entire family.

21:39.250 --> 21:40.510
When Mr. Qiao returns,

21:40.570 --> 21:42.030
if anyone with ill intentions

21:42.030 --> 21:43.760
goes to him to gossip about you,

21:43.760 --> 21:45.020
you'll all be done for.

21:50.610 --> 21:51.440
Gu.

21:52.680 --> 21:53.730
Wait here for me.

21:55.400 --> 21:57.000
I have something to give you.

22:12.000 --> 22:14.190
[Betrothal Letter]

22:14.570 --> 22:16.070
My father asked me to give this to you.

22:16.070 --> 22:18.170
[Betrothal Letter]

22:20.880 --> 22:21.480
Yimei,

22:23.270 --> 22:25.530
you returned the betrothal letter to me.

22:26.240 --> 22:27.370
What does this mean?

22:28.720 --> 22:30.520
Are you rejecting our marriage?

22:31.720 --> 22:32.510
Gu,

22:33.640 --> 22:34.460
your words...

22:34.910 --> 22:36.710
You got me wrong with your words.

22:38.290 --> 22:39.580
[Betrothal Letter]

22:39.440 --> 22:41.660
My father wrote this himself.

22:40.080 --> 22:40.260
[I'm too old for more disgrace.]

22:40.260 --> 22:40.450
[The betrothal letter is returned
for you two to split up peacefully.]

22:41.880 --> 22:42.740
Check this out.

22:43.920 --> 22:45.060
"I'm too old

22:45.790 --> 22:47.080
for more disgrace.

22:47.960 --> 22:49.820
The betrothal letter is returned

22:50.030 --> 22:52.030
for you two to split up peacefully."

22:53.270 --> 22:55.340
If Pingyuan returns alive,

22:56.570 --> 22:58.080
give this to him.

22:59.200 --> 23:00.840
Someone must survive.

23:03.380 --> 23:04.790
He'll get what I mean,

23:04.810 --> 23:05.720
and so do you.

23:10.070 --> 23:10.940
Girl,

23:12.220 --> 23:13.520
you're still so young.

23:14.180 --> 23:15.240
You shouldn't die.

23:18.510 --> 23:20.370
Pingwen also persuaded my father

23:21.240 --> 23:22.640
to let our family escape.

23:23.160 --> 23:24.000
My father said

23:24.640 --> 23:25.700
that if we ran away,

23:26.670 --> 23:27.790
it would put you in danger

23:27.790 --> 23:28.460
and confirm the accusation

23:28.460 --> 23:30.160
of your collusion with the enemy.

23:30.160 --> 23:32.240
War and unrest are raging everywhere.

23:32.240 --> 23:33.070
Even if we flee,

23:33.070 --> 23:34.600
where could we possibly go?

23:34.930 --> 23:37.190
We've known each other since childhood.

23:37.880 --> 23:40.090
Our families have been friends
for generations.

23:40.090 --> 23:42.150
Even without this betrothal letter,

23:42.200 --> 23:42.980
I can't just stand by

23:42.980 --> 23:44.580
and watch you be humiliated.

23:45.200 --> 23:45.920
I'll protect you

23:45.920 --> 23:47.380
even at the cost of my life.

23:48.510 --> 23:50.210
This is my father's wish.

23:50.960 --> 23:52.310
I will never defy him.

23:54.160 --> 23:55.420
You should go home now.

23:55.830 --> 23:57.920
Come back when he's feeling better.

26:33.690 --> 26:36.680
[Gu's Mansion]

26:37.880 --> 26:38.440
Mr. Bai?

26:45.820 --> 26:47.160
Yimei is missing.

26:47.960 --> 26:49.420
Yimei is missing.

26:50.550 --> 26:51.280
Don't panic.

26:51.880 --> 26:53.010
I'll go look for her.

26:53.200 --> 26:54.000
I'll find her.

26:58.890 --> 26:59.510
Mr. Bai,

26:59.790 --> 27:01.120
let's go inside to talk.

27:11.570 --> 27:12.240
Mr. Bai!

27:20.290 --> 27:23.320
[Liuhu Town]

27:57.830 --> 27:58.680
Bowls.

27:59.950 --> 28:00.930
Rice bowls.

28:01.640 --> 28:02.680
Rice pots.

28:04.070 --> 28:05.070
Hoes.

28:06.400 --> 28:08.400
Take your pick, Sir or Madam.

28:12.810 --> 28:14.410
If you sell all these things,

28:15.610 --> 28:17.270
how will you survive?

28:26.470 --> 28:28.210
My two sons

28:28.440 --> 28:29.750
and two grandsons were

28:30.850 --> 28:32.530
regarded as rebels

28:33.510 --> 28:34.720
and beheaded

28:35.880 --> 28:37.440
for them to claim credit.

28:38.720 --> 28:41.830
I have no future anymore.

28:46.400 --> 28:48.110
Where are those soldiers?

28:48.950 --> 28:50.670
The imperial court's troops are

28:50.670 --> 28:52.270
stationed outside the town.

28:52.640 --> 28:53.640
The Southern Army

28:54.440 --> 28:55.680
went to Hefei.

29:37.510 --> 29:38.870
You there! Stop!

29:39.660 --> 29:40.280
Catch him!

29:40.640 --> 29:41.260
A spy!

30:07.710 --> 30:08.870
It's a woman!

30:10.510 --> 30:11.810
And quite a pretty one!

30:16.350 --> 30:17.680
Whose soldiers are you?

30:19.400 --> 30:20.350
Don't block the way.

30:20.350 --> 30:21.010
Move aside!

30:26.920 --> 30:28.190
An ant wears a bridle,

30:28.720 --> 30:30.380
pretending to be a big animal.

30:30.920 --> 30:32.570
How dare you speak to me like that?

30:32.570 --> 30:33.780
Do you want to die?

30:34.350 --> 30:36.240
You're just a petty battalion commander.

30:36.240 --> 30:37.420
Who are you to act high and mighty here?

30:37.420 --> 30:38.620
Get out of the way now!

30:40.630 --> 30:42.150
Who's that?

30:53.170 --> 30:54.730
What a good-looking pansy.

30:54.830 --> 30:56.420
Come have some fun with us.

30:58.160 --> 31:00.140
I never thought General Qiao's soldiers

31:00.140 --> 31:01.750
would be such a crew of scum.

31:07.960 --> 31:08.640
Who

31:08.790 --> 31:09.510
are you?

31:09.880 --> 31:11.340
You don't deserve to know.

31:11.480 --> 31:13.610
This is General Qiao's honored guest.

31:13.650 --> 31:15.710
Asking too much might get you killed!

31:20.570 --> 31:22.030
Where are you going, lady?

31:26.660 --> 31:27.560
Get off your horse

31:27.560 --> 31:28.960
and get into my carriage.

31:29.960 --> 31:31.360
They won't dare hurt you.

31:33.360 --> 31:34.760
I need to go find someone.

31:35.750 --> 31:37.200
If I let go of the reins,

31:37.270 --> 31:38.550
you won't be able to go anywhere,

31:38.550 --> 31:39.950
as they'll take you away.

31:40.590 --> 31:41.660
Who knows what these people are

31:41.660 --> 31:42.460
going to do?

31:43.590 --> 31:44.160
Get down.

31:44.200 --> 31:45.200
I'll protect you.

31:50.200 --> 31:50.860
Stop there!

31:51.920 --> 31:53.570
I've been looking all over for you.
Where have you been?

31:53.570 --> 31:55.270
General Qiao, I was looking for you, too.

31:55.270 --> 31:56.070
Why did you...

31:56.070 --> 31:57.440
A rich person came from the south.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.300
I can't see her.

31:58.350 --> 31:59.610
She specifically asked to see you.

31:59.610 --> 32:00.200
Who?

32:00.240 --> 32:01.040
A rich person!

32:01.510 --> 32:01.920
Wait.

32:02.140 --> 32:02.680
Mr. Qiao.

32:02.710 --> 32:03.960
Someone from my family is missing.

32:03.960 --> 32:04.920
I was hoping to get some news from you.

32:04.920 --> 32:05.960
In this chaotic period,

32:05.960 --> 32:07.880
someone going missing is nothing rare.

32:07.880 --> 32:08.700
I've accommodated

32:08.700 --> 32:10.180
that guest in the tent on the north side.

32:10.180 --> 32:11.580
If you mess this thing up,

32:11.590 --> 32:12.650
I won't let you off.

32:12.750 --> 32:13.280
Let's go!

32:17.230 --> 32:20.340
[The Qing Army's Camp]

32:27.110 --> 32:28.000
Mr. Gu,

32:28.900 --> 32:31.430
how have you been
since our parting in Shanxi?

32:32.830 --> 32:33.750
Ms. Su,

32:34.640 --> 32:36.040
have you been doing well?

32:37.160 --> 32:37.880
Me?

32:38.180 --> 32:39.980
No, I've been anything but well.

32:40.440 --> 32:41.450
You messed up

32:41.480 --> 32:42.510
my plan in Shanxi.

32:48.680 --> 32:50.000
Don't bother finding a way out.

32:50.000 --> 32:51.200
It's not like Shanxi,

32:51.640 --> 32:53.970
where you could disappear into the crowd.

32:55.680 --> 32:57.010
Your home is right here.

32:57.100 --> 32:59.160
Your mother, your younger brother,

32:59.750 --> 33:00.920
and that

33:02.340 --> 33:04.730
beautiful Miss Bai.

33:06.310 --> 33:07.840
How do you know everything?

33:07.900 --> 33:09.050
I won't let the same person

33:09.050 --> 33:10.060
get me twice.

33:11.000 --> 33:12.370
If I hadn't investigated you thoroughly,

33:12.370 --> 33:13.700
how would I dare to come?

33:16.810 --> 33:18.480
I have something to show you.

33:28.640 --> 33:29.510
You got Yimei?

33:32.790 --> 33:33.400
Tell me

33:33.810 --> 33:34.680
what you want me to do

33:34.680 --> 33:35.540
to release her.

33:35.760 --> 33:37.250
You're such a hypocrite.

33:38.070 --> 33:39.240
Don't you know she can't stay

33:39.240 --> 33:40.640
in her hometown anymore?

33:40.920 --> 33:42.270
With her status as a collaborator,

33:42.270 --> 33:43.660
aren't you afraid
it'll implicate your mother

33:43.660 --> 33:44.660
and your brother?

33:45.450 --> 33:47.050
I came here today to meet you.

33:47.240 --> 33:48.040
Saving her was

33:48.100 --> 33:49.270
an unexpected gain.

33:49.550 --> 33:50.480
I'm begging you.

33:55.300 --> 33:56.700
Please take me to see her.

34:00.940 --> 34:04.540
[Li Cheng’s Military Camp, Hefei]

34:24.040 --> 34:25.130
It really is you.

34:27.489 --> 34:28.840
My men told me that you were here.

34:28.840 --> 34:29.840
I didn't believe it.

34:29.840 --> 34:32.040
But I didn't expect it to be you for real.

34:32.110 --> 34:32.860
Okay.

34:33.150 --> 34:33.880
I won't move.

34:35.000 --> 34:36.260
You don't move either.

34:38.110 --> 34:39.510
Let's just stay like this

34:40.040 --> 34:41.219
and have a good talk.

34:46.909 --> 34:48.260
They said you died.

34:48.670 --> 34:49.940
Died in Liuhu Town.

34:56.300 --> 34:58.430
With iron grit embedded in your bones,

34:58.940 --> 35:00.000
not removed yet,

35:00.400 --> 35:01.780
it hurts on rainy days.

35:02.070 --> 35:03.670
You must pay attention to it.

35:04.030 --> 35:04.440
I...

35:06.380 --> 35:07.500
Looks like your jade pendant

35:07.500 --> 35:08.900
can really work wonders.

35:09.440 --> 35:10.240
You know what?

35:10.550 --> 35:11.880
I prayed to her every day

35:12.610 --> 35:14.170
just to let me see you again.

35:14.200 --> 35:15.940
For that, I'd even accept the fate

35:15.940 --> 35:18.270
of being torn into pieces with no regrets.

35:20.110 --> 35:21.240
Where are you going?

35:26.320 --> 35:27.450
Where are you going?

35:27.960 --> 35:28.960
Let me escort you.

35:36.030 --> 35:37.440
I have nowhere to go.

35:41.360 --> 35:43.110
Before I came, I thought

35:44.230 --> 35:45.490
that if you were alive,

35:46.770 --> 35:48.500
I'd like to tell you something.

35:55.780 --> 35:57.530
You can't just walk away

35:58.370 --> 35:59.830
after lighting up my life.

36:17.200 --> 36:18.470
These days,

36:18.710 --> 36:19.860
what's been embedded in my bones is

36:19.860 --> 36:20.990
not just iron grit,

36:23.840 --> 36:25.370
but also my longing for you.

36:30.700 --> 36:31.490
Stay.

36:32.450 --> 36:34.050
Even if it's just for one day,

36:35.000 --> 36:35.920
to me,

36:37.190 --> 36:38.920
it's worth more than 100 years.

37:05.870 --> 37:10.680
[Gu's Mansion]

37:15.590 --> 37:16.070
Mother.

37:17.150 --> 37:17.880
You're back.

37:18.990 --> 37:20.390
This time, Mr. Bai

37:22.060 --> 37:23.860
won't pull through, I'm afraid.

37:25.960 --> 37:26.760
That's right.

37:32.230 --> 37:34.230
You and Pingwen are both lying to me.

37:34.890 --> 37:36.370
Both of you are fooling me.

37:36.840 --> 37:37.360
Mother.

37:38.550 --> 37:40.150
Where exactly did Yimei go?

37:41.930 --> 37:43.710
Those rumors spreading in the village,

37:43.710 --> 37:45.060
are they true?

37:48.340 --> 37:49.000
I saw

37:49.030 --> 37:50.670
that girl grow up.

37:51.070 --> 37:53.930
How did she change so much,
like a different person?

37:55.590 --> 37:57.200
Even if you no longer

37:58.180 --> 37:59.910
have an engagement with Yimei,

38:01.400 --> 38:02.360
you and your brother

38:02.360 --> 38:04.560
have received great favor from Mr. Bai.

38:05.520 --> 38:06.480
When you were little,

38:06.480 --> 38:08.760
Mr. Bai taught you to read and write,

38:08.780 --> 38:10.870
showing the same care as parents.

38:13.330 --> 38:14.880
During the years you were away,

38:14.880 --> 38:17.150
Yimei came
to take care of me from time to time.

38:17.150 --> 38:18.250
No matter what,

38:18.590 --> 38:19.670
you must find her

38:20.070 --> 38:21.940
and tell me the truth!

38:22.280 --> 38:22.760
Mother.

38:24.710 --> 38:25.690
Today, I...

38:26.590 --> 38:27.190
I saw an acquaintance

38:27.190 --> 38:28.390
at the military camp.

38:29.550 --> 38:30.490
She told me

38:32.800 --> 38:34.060
that Yimei went there.

38:36.330 --> 38:37.510
Where did she go?

38:39.460 --> 38:40.230
She said

38:41.920 --> 38:44.320
that Yimei went
to the Southern Army's camp

38:44.550 --> 38:45.070
to find

38:45.070 --> 38:46.730
that general called Li Cheng.

39:02.220 --> 39:03.420
What a troublemaker.

39:04.980 --> 39:06.420
You all screwed it up.

39:06.590 --> 39:08.070
What are you mumbling about?

39:08.070 --> 39:09.070
I'm saying that you

39:09.070 --> 39:10.470
might as well not have come back.

39:10.470 --> 39:12.270
You stirred up such big trouble.

39:12.400 --> 39:13.530
How is that my fault?

39:14.220 --> 39:15.510
She's already a grown-up.

39:15.510 --> 39:17.640
How can I meddle in what she wants to do?

39:17.650 --> 39:18.300
You all feel bad,

39:18.300 --> 39:19.800
like I don't feel upset, huh?

39:19.800 --> 39:21.730
Why is everyone taking it out on me?

39:21.840 --> 39:23.240
Well, after your return,

39:23.540 --> 39:24.280
I thought life

39:24.280 --> 39:25.650
would get better day by day.

39:25.650 --> 39:26.360
But now,

39:26.670 --> 39:28.330
it's getting worse every day!

39:28.730 --> 39:29.400
In my point of view,

39:29.400 --> 39:31.360
Bai Yimei is not
one of our family after all.

39:31.360 --> 39:34.120
You should take good care
of Mother and me first.

39:34.710 --> 39:35.480
Yimei's departure

39:35.480 --> 39:36.030
made the two

39:36.030 --> 39:37.340
old folks barely hold on.

39:37.340 --> 39:38.550
What am I supposed to tell them?

39:38.550 --> 39:39.840
Just persuade her to come back!

39:39.840 --> 39:40.880
Do I seem

39:40.920 --> 39:42.320
that persuasive or what?

39:42.800 --> 39:44.100
You think she'll listen to me?

39:44.100 --> 39:45.510
You're just shirking responsibility,

39:45.510 --> 39:46.550
not caring about anyone,

39:46.550 --> 39:47.400
not even me.

39:48.350 --> 39:49.590
How am I not caring about you?

39:49.590 --> 39:51.120
How are you caring about me?

39:54.080 --> 39:55.200
Let's sort this out.

39:55.200 --> 39:56.630
How long have you been back?

39:56.630 --> 39:57.380
Didn't you promise

39:57.380 --> 39:58.550
to teach me how to do business?

39:58.550 --> 39:59.610
Have you taught me?

39:59.960 --> 40:01.300
You also promised to help us

40:01.300 --> 40:03.030
make our lives better and better.

40:03.030 --> 40:04.430
Has it gotten any better?

40:05.320 --> 40:06.900
I'm just an ordinary folk.

40:07.090 --> 40:08.510
I don't have time to observe

40:08.510 --> 40:10.730
who's giving someone different looks

40:10.760 --> 40:12.210
or whose tone of voice has changed.

40:12.210 --> 40:13.000
But I do know

40:13.070 --> 40:15.510
that clothes and food all cost money!

40:15.530 --> 40:16.430
Keep it down.

40:17.100 --> 40:18.630
Getting someone to roast tea for sale

40:18.630 --> 40:19.630
also costs money!

40:19.670 --> 40:20.760
Big shots fighting down the mountain,

40:20.760 --> 40:22.420
what does it have to do with us?

40:22.430 --> 40:24.280
You might as well go back to Ningguta!

40:24.280 --> 40:24.670
I...

40:32.710 --> 40:34.800
I don't have time to fight with you today.

40:34.800 --> 40:36.030
Tomorrow, come with me

40:36.030 --> 40:37.090
down the mountain.

40:40.680 --> 40:42.210
All you do is boss me around.

41:00.110 --> 41:00.710
Pingyuan,

41:01.020 --> 41:02.090
you're being so mysterious.

41:02.090 --> 41:03.150
You haven't told me

41:03.150 --> 41:04.610
why you brought me to town.

41:19.360 --> 41:20.800
What are you looking for?

41:22.960 --> 41:23.550
What do you think?

41:23.220 --> 41:25.260
[Ping]

41:24.030 --> 41:24.960
What do you mean?

41:26.110 --> 41:27.630
This is the shop I rented for you.

41:27.630 --> 41:28.760
Go in and take a look.

41:30.710 --> 41:34.820
[Ping]

41:31.590 --> 41:32.750
You rented it for me?

41:33.320 --> 41:34.580
Why didn't you tell me?

41:35.790 --> 41:36.720
Here, take this.

41:42.710 --> 41:43.840
200 taels of silver?

41:44.600 --> 41:46.030
Where did you get so much money?

41:46.030 --> 41:47.320
I'm not forcing you to do anything.

41:47.320 --> 41:48.180
You can take this money,

41:48.180 --> 41:49.440
go straight back home,

41:49.440 --> 41:50.400
lock it in a box,

41:50.560 --> 41:52.560
and continue working in the fields.

41:53.490 --> 41:54.000
Of course,

41:54.000 --> 41:55.010
you could also try

41:55.100 --> 41:56.400
this business of buying and selling,

41:56.400 --> 41:57.440
the life of a merchant.

41:57.440 --> 41:58.440
It's your choice.

41:59.670 --> 42:00.840
I've had enough of scratching out

42:00.840 --> 42:02.000
a living from the soil.

42:02.000 --> 42:03.530
I'll pick a different path.

42:09.320 --> 42:11.050
-Head Manager.
-Head Manager.

42:11.120 --> 42:12.300
Let me introduce you all.

42:12.300 --> 42:13.850
This is your real head manager,

42:13.850 --> 42:14.690
Gu Pingwen.

42:14.840 --> 42:15.570
I am the Boss.

42:16.150 --> 42:17.070
-Manager
-Manager

42:17.070 --> 42:17.590
Well...

42:18.270 --> 42:19.920
Go buy some food from the market.

42:19.920 --> 42:21.850
Your manager and I need to have a talk.

42:21.850 --> 42:22.710
Okay. Let's go.

42:37.070 --> 42:38.150
"Ping"?

42:37.290 --> 42:43.600
[Ping]

42:38.590 --> 42:39.140
Yes.

42:39.230 --> 42:40.230
What's your name?

42:40.230 --> 42:40.890
Gu Pingwen.

42:40.920 --> 42:41.440
That's right.

42:41.440 --> 42:42.590
Your name is Gu Pingwen,

42:42.590 --> 42:44.000
so this shop is called Ping.

42:44.000 --> 42:44.710
From now on,

42:44.820 --> 42:46.220
this shop belongs to you.

42:47.050 --> 42:48.110
And I also selected

42:48.190 --> 42:49.710
those two assistants for you.

42:49.710 --> 42:50.630
They're loyal, reliable,

42:50.630 --> 42:51.630
and experienced.

42:52.310 --> 42:53.550
As for the 200 taels of silver,

42:53.550 --> 42:54.810
it's enough to pay them for a year

42:54.810 --> 42:56.340
and cover the cost of goods.

42:58.110 --> 42:59.190
So, Pingyuan, what business

42:59.190 --> 43:00.190
does this shop do?

43:00.630 --> 43:02.110
You're the head manager now.

43:02.110 --> 43:02.630
It's up to you.
